# REVIEW.md

Read when:
- reviewing a frozen long-run result
- writing independent review reports
- normalizing feedback into fix tickets

Update when:
- review freeze is created
- validation evidence changes before review starts

Do not:
- modify product code while updating this file
- mix reviewer opinions into one shared report before independent reports are complete

